<title>UK: Harrisons &amp; Crosfield names finance head.</title>
<headline>Harrisons &amp; Crosfield names finance head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK chemicals company Harrisons &amp; Crosfield Plc said on Tuesday it had named George Fairweather as its group finance director.</p>
<p>Fairweather will join Harrisons from Scottish-based textile group Dawson International Plc.</p>
<p>In a separate statement, Dawson said it had named Paul Munn to replace Fairweather, effective February 1.</p>
<p>Munn is presently Dawson's manager of corporate development.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
